
@server = http://localhost:4004

### 1. Read all customers
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/sales/Customers

### 2. Read all products
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/sales/Products

### 3. Customer with their orders
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/sales/Customers?$expand=orders

### 4. Order with customer and items
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/sales/Orders?$expand=customer,items($expand=product($select=name))



